WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.921
The fairies began flying back to Mabel's house.

2
00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:13.076
The strong wind blew Feather backward.

3
00:00:13.077 --> 00:00:17.155
"Wait for me!" she cried.

4
00:00:17.156 --> 00:00:22.907
But another gust blew the fairies all over.

5
00:00:22.908 --> 00:00:28.333
"Everybody, let’s meet at Mabel's house!" Sprite yelled.

6
00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:32.363
"Okay!" Feather shouted over the wind.

7
00:00:32.364 --> 00:00:38.686
"I have the wishbit!"

8
00:00:38.687 --> 00:00:41.311
Feather kept flying.

9
00:00:41.312 --> 00:00:45.605
Thunder boomed, and the wind blew hard.

10
00:00:45.606 --> 00:00:49.275
"It's too hard to fly," she thought.

11
00:00:49.276 --> 00:00:56.336
"I'll land and wait for the storm to pass." Feather

12
00:00:56.337 --> 00:01:01.281
landed under a tree on a lawn. Suddenly

13
00:01:01.282 --> 00:01:04.635
she heard people talking. "Uh-oh!"

14
00:01:04.636 --> 00:01:09.221
she thought. "I have to hide!" Feather

15
00:01:09.222 --> 00:01:11.734
put the wishbit beside her. Quickly

16
00:01:11.735 --> 00:01:20.440
she turned into a feather. "Look,

17
00:01:20.441 --> 00:01:28.985
Dad!" a boy cried. "A pretty feather!" "Come

18
00:01:28.986 --> 00:01:32.003
on, Hassan," his father said. "Let's

19
00:01:32.004 --> 00:01:34.234
get out of the rain." Hassan

20
00:01:34.235 --> 00:01:36.753
bent over Feather. "No,

21
00:01:36.754 --> 00:01:39.133
no, no," she thought. "Please

22
00:01:39.134 --> 00:01:41.531
don't pick me up!" Just

23
00:01:41.532 --> 00:01:48.883
then Hassan spotted something else. "Ooh!"

24
00:01:48.884 --> 00:01:54.253
Hassan cried. "A gold whistle!" "Oh

25
00:01:54.254 --> 00:01:57.654
no!" Feather thought. Hassan

26
00:01:57.655 --> 00:02:01.383
grabbed the whistle, spinning the cord on his finger. Then—

27
00:02:01.384 --> 00:02:06.305
tweet! He blew hard.

28
00:02:06.306 --> 00:02:09.959
"Put that whistle back, Hassan," his father said.

29
00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.013
"It doesn't belong to you.

30
00:02:12.014 --> 00:02:14.743
And come on—it's raining hard!"

31
00:02:14.744 --> 00:02:21.278
Hassan sighed and tossed the whistle back onto the grass.

32
00:02:21.279 --> 00:02:26.879
"Whew!" Feather thought. "That was a close call."

33
00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:30.936
She changed into herself again and grabbed the whistle. "Now

34
00:02:30.937 --> 00:02:39.915
back to Mabel's house!" Soon

35
00:02:39.916 --> 00:02:44.285
Feather was flying over a muddy field. "Almost

36
00:02:44.286 --> 00:02:49.629
there," she thought, dipping lower. The

37
00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:54.234
wind blew hard. Then— boom!

38
00:02:54.235 --> 00:02:56.887
A crack of thunder startled Feather.

39
00:02:56.888 --> 00:02:59.872
She jumped—and dropped the whistle!

40
00:02:59.873 --> 00:03:05.079
The whistle tumbled down into the field below.

41
00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:09.563
Feather shot downward and landed.

42
00:03:09.564 --> 00:03:12.526
Mud and puddles covered the ground.

43
00:03:12.527 --> 00:03:23.295
"Oh no!" she groaned. "I'll never find the wishbit!"

